    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The proposed construction of&amp;nbsp; a second floor by reason of its bulk and massing would create an obtrusive and overbearing development which would fail to respect the character of the property and wider shopping parade and would significantly detract from the established and prevailing pattern of development in the area, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the property and the street scene, contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policy D3 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
